WEBVTT

00:06.927 --> 00:07.927
<b>[gasps]</b>

00:08.977 --> 00:10.347
<b>How exciting.</b>

00:10.437 --> 00:12.477
<b>You're the one who will
be teaching me this book, yes?</b>

00:14.727 --> 00:15.817
<b>[exclaims softly]</b>

00:15.937 --> 00:18.487
<b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b>

00:25.827 --> 00:28.537
<b>JAADUGAR</b>

01:47.077 --> 01:48.617
<b>[SORGHAGHTANI] Most incredible.</b>

01:48.737 --> 01:50.947
<b>Now I have my very own copy
of Elements.</b>

01:51.077 --> 01:52.197
<b>OTCHIGIN</b>

01:52.327 --> 01:54.077
<b>And Tolui found it, just for me.</b>

01:55.787 --> 01:57.337
<b>What is your name?</b>

01:59.457 --> 02:01.757
<b>Fatima, that is my name.</b>

02:01.837 --> 02:05.177
<b>I help you in studies, Highness.
Happy to teach things.</b>

02:05.507 --> 02:07.177
<b>I can't wait.</b>

02:07.297 --> 02:08.757
<b>-[SITARA] Although...
-Hm?</b>

02:08.887 --> 02:12.847
<b>I feel confused.
Why is it Highness want book?</b>

02:12.977 --> 02:14.637
<b>It holds not much value.</b>

02:14.767 --> 02:15.687
<b>[SORGHAGHTANI] Huh?</b>

02:15.807 --> 02:18.107
<b>All it does is
just state obvious.</b>

02:18.227 --> 02:21.227
<b>It says, "A point is that
which has no part."</b>

02:21.567 --> 02:23.697
<b>And, "A line
is breadthless length."</b>

02:23.817 --> 02:25.487
<b>You see? It is useless.</b>

02:27.447 --> 02:28.487
<b>Oh.</b>

02:29.367 --> 02:30.537
<b>[SITARA] I'm still not sure</b>

02:30.697 --> 02:32.907
<b>why she ever wanted the book
to begin with.</b>

02:33.537 --> 02:34.617
<b>But I could tell</b>

02:35.117 --> 02:37.997
<b>the prince didn't have any idea
how valuable it really was.</b>

02:38.837 --> 02:41.087
<b>There's a chance
she might part ways with it</b>

02:41.207 --> 02:42.757
<b>if she starts losing interest.</b>

02:42.877 --> 02:45.127
<b>It just states the obvious.</b>

02:45.257 --> 02:47.217
<b>Indeed it does. That's true.</b>

02:47.337 --> 02:50.177
<b>-At least for your people.
-[gasps]</b>

02:50.297 --> 02:53.177
<b>But for us, this book
represents something more,</b>

02:53.307 --> 02:54.807
<b>and it's very special.</b>

02:54.937 --> 02:56.477
<b>By studying its pages,</b>

02:56.597 --> 02:58.687
<b>we will acquire
Western knowledge not found</b>

02:58.807 --> 03:00.397
<b>-on the steppe.
-Huh?</b>

03:01.107 --> 03:04.227
<b>Tolui is the Otchigin
and serves a crucial role.</b>

03:04.987 --> 03:08.197
<b>He's the keeper of the hearth,
watching over its fire.</b>

03:08.567 --> 03:10.947
<b>Even after
his older brothers set off,</b>

03:11.077 --> 03:12.787
<b>and received their own pastures,</b>

03:13.197 --> 03:16.077
<b>as the youngest son,
he remains in the household,</b>

03:16.207 --> 03:19.037
<b>guarding the family fortune
he'll inherit one day.</b>

03:19.497 --> 03:21.497
<b>And because he's the Otchigin,</b>

03:21.627 --> 03:23.247
<b>my husband
will become the emperor.</b>

03:24.127 --> 03:26.917
<b>That said, he isn't exactly
what you might call</b>

03:27.047 --> 03:28.177
<b>the brightest at times.</b>

03:28.297 --> 03:30.387
<b>-[kids laughing]
-But it's not just him.</b>

03:30.507 --> 03:32.347
<b>Many of our people
are the same way.</b>

03:32.467 --> 03:35.307
<b>They know only of life
out here on the steppe.</b>

03:36.307 --> 03:39.307
<b>Vast as it may be,
the world is vaster still,</b>

03:40.307 --> 03:42.017
<b>and I wish to learn more...</b>

03:42.147 --> 03:44.357
<b>about the lands within reach
of Mongol hooves</b>

03:44.477 --> 03:46.147
<b>and the ones even farther.</b>

03:46.647 --> 03:48.567
<b>I've heard
that your people have been able</b>

03:48.697 --> 03:49.817
<b>to successfully
predict the movement</b>

03:49.947 --> 03:51.697
<b>of the stars since antiquity.</b>

03:52.657 --> 03:53.947
<b>How curious!</b>

03:54.197 --> 03:56.657
<b>To think that you're able
to figure out the Earth's size!</b>

03:57.997 --> 03:59.577
<b>Are you saying
this person traveled</b>

03:59.707 --> 04:00.877
<b>to the ends of the Earth?</b>

04:00.997 --> 04:03.787
<b>Of course not.
He just used geometry.</b>

04:03.917 --> 04:05.547
<b>You know what makes
obvious things</b>

04:05.667 --> 04:06.587
<b>seem more obvious?</b>

04:06.717 --> 04:09.127
<b>We prove
all universal principles</b>

04:09.257 --> 04:11.927
<b>after amassing examples
one by one.</b>

04:12.717 --> 04:16.557
<b>I must gain knowledge for all
of our future generations.</b>

04:17.427 --> 04:18.727
<b>As I see it,</b>

04:18.937 --> 04:21.727
<b>that is the role of someone
who will be empress one day.</b>

04:21.857 --> 04:23.107
<b>[Sitara gasps softly]</b>

04:27.237 --> 04:30.067
<b>[SITARA] Oh, why is it...</b>

04:30.197 --> 04:32.197
<b>why is it that she...</b>

04:33.737 --> 04:36.367
<b>Why does she infuriate me so?</b>

04:36.907 --> 04:38.577
<b>Do you even have
the faintest idea</b>

04:38.697 --> 04:40.997
<b>how that book ended up
in your hands?</b>

04:41.577 --> 04:42.917
<b>Do you think you can imagine</b>

04:43.037 --> 04:44.877
<b>the misery and anguish
we must endure</b>

04:44.997 --> 04:47.297
<b>when thanking those
who robbed us of everything</b>

04:47.417 --> 04:49.047
<b>for the charity you now offer?</b>

04:50.467 --> 04:52.757
<b>Do you know nothing
of how I truly feel</b>

04:52.887 --> 04:55.007
<b>as I'm being forced
to sit here at your feet?</b>

04:55.757 --> 04:58.467
<b>Something wrong? I hope
you aren't feeling unwell.</b>

04:59.477 --> 05:00.887
<b>[Sitara cries softly]</b>

05:01.017 --> 05:02.847
<b>No, I admire you.</b>

05:02.977 --> 05:04.477
<b>[Sorghaghtani chuckles softly]</b>

05:04.607 --> 05:07.107
<b>A great pleasure
to serve Highness.</b>

05:07.227 --> 05:09.187
<b>I work hard, I swear.</b>

05:09.897 --> 05:12.857
<b>I'm grateful to have your help,
so thank you.</b>

05:13.237 --> 05:15.947
<b>I know you must be tired.
You may rest now.</b>

05:17.287 --> 05:18.907
<b>I excuse myself.</b>

05:22.827 --> 05:24.167
<b>[Sitara grunts]</b>

05:25.207 --> 05:26.877
<b>Such wisdom as yours</b>

05:26.997 --> 05:29.167
<b>is something
our people desperately need.</b>

05:29.587 --> 05:32.467
<b>[SITARA] I feel ashamed
for wavering back then,</b>

05:32.587 --> 05:34.507
<b>if only for even a moment.</b>

05:36.137 --> 05:37.467
<b>But now...</b>

05:41.097 --> 05:45.437
<b>I mustn't allow myself
to forget this anger inside.</b>

05:45.557 --> 05:48.567
<b>I will never yield...
to that woman.</b>

05:50.187 --> 05:52.067
<b>[wind blowing]</b>

06:10.797 --> 06:12.457
<b>Oh, welcome back, Fatima.</b>

06:12.587 --> 06:14.587
<b>I thank you
for venturing out here</b>

06:14.717 --> 06:16.257
<b>even in this sandstorm.</b>

06:16.637 --> 06:17.797
<b>You're welcome.</b>

06:18.507 --> 06:21.427
<b>Here in Mongolia,
once the sandstorms have passed,</b>

06:21.557 --> 06:23.017
<b>spring will soon follow.</b>

06:23.137 --> 06:25.727
<b>How I miss Persia
in the springtime.</b>

06:26.437 --> 06:29.687
<b>My mother still has
not adjusted well to life here.</b>

06:29.817 --> 06:30.937
<b>[Sitara sighs softly]</b>

06:33.197 --> 06:35.027
<b>-[KHESHIG] Fatima.
-[SITARA] Hm?</b>

06:35.147 --> 06:37.657
<b>[KHESHIG] Princess Sorghaghtani
is asking for you.</b>

06:37.777 --> 06:39.947
<b>She'd like
to begin her studies now.</b>

06:41.827 --> 06:43.407
<b>I would be happy to.</b>

06:43.537 --> 06:45.957
<b>♪</b>

06:56.677 --> 06:57.797
<b>[Sitara grunts]</b>

06:59.507 --> 07:00.927
<b>-[barking]
-[Sitara groans]</b>

07:01.057 --> 07:03.517
<b>Look at your face.
What happened to you?</b>

07:04.097 --> 07:07.017
<b>There are far too many animals
in Mongolia.</b>

07:07.347 --> 07:09.767
<b>And they're nothing
but a big nuisance.</b>

07:09.897 --> 07:11.477
<b>Perhaps so.</b>

07:12.017 --> 07:14.947
<b>But once you get to know them,
they can be rather charming.</b>

07:16.447 --> 07:17.907
<b>Can they now?</b>

07:21.327 --> 07:22.987
<b>[grunting]</b>

07:27.247 --> 07:29.787
<b>Uh... [sighs]</b>

07:30.707 --> 07:32.457
<b>♪</b>

07:39.297 --> 07:40.837
<b>[WOMAN 1] Here you go.</b>

07:41.097 --> 07:42.757
<b>Now just a moment.</b>

07:43.177 --> 07:45.677
<b>It's already
our second winter here.</b>

07:46.017 --> 07:48.437
<b>It appears that your health
is improving, Mother.</b>

07:48.557 --> 07:52.227
<b>[WOMAN 2] Well, I've finally
gotten used to life in Mongolia.</b>

07:52.477 --> 07:53.517
<b>[WOMAN 3] I don't think</b>

07:53.607 --> 07:55.897
<b>I'll ever get used
to this cold weather.</b>

08:00.237 --> 08:01.657
<b>[Sitara whistles]</b>

08:02.697 --> 08:04.327
<b>[sheep bleating]</b>

08:04.447 --> 08:05.747
<b>Tchou, tchou!</b>

08:09.327 --> 08:11.077
<b>SUMMER, A.D. 1224</b>

08:11.747 --> 08:13.337
<b>[SITARA (ADULT)]
Three years had passed</b>

08:13.457 --> 08:17.007
<b>after Sitara became
Princess Sorghaghtani's tutor.</b>

08:18.047 --> 08:21.257
<b>The Mongol army defeated
the Shah of the Khwarazm,</b>

08:21.387 --> 08:23.887
<b>a major power in Central Asia,</b>

08:24.007 --> 08:27.517
<b>and returned in triumph to
their home camp on the steppe.</b>

08:28.517 --> 08:29.977
<b>To welcome them back,</b>

08:30.097 --> 08:32.187
<b>Sorghaghtani and the members
of her court</b>

08:32.307 --> 08:35.017
<b>traveled southwest
of the Altai Mountains</b>

08:35.147 --> 08:36.607
<b>to the basin of the Emil River,</b>

08:37.107 --> 08:40.317
<b>where they feasted and hunted
to celebrate their victory.</b>

08:41.697 --> 08:43.777
<b>[HULEGU] Hey, Father!</b>

08:43.907 --> 08:45.907
<b>[TOLUI] Hulegu! Kublai!</b>

08:46.027 --> 08:47.787
<b>I took down this deer by myself.</b>

08:47.907 --> 08:49.747
<b>And I brought back a hare.</b>

08:50.077 --> 08:52.207
<b>[TOLUI]
You two take after your father.</b>

08:52.327 --> 08:53.917
<b>[HULEGU] Did you see?</b>

08:54.037 --> 08:56.087
<b>This was my first time
to go on a hunt.</b>

08:56.207 --> 08:57.667
<b>-Aren't I so amazing?
-[laughter]</b>

08:57.797 --> 09:01.047
<b>You truly are amazing. [laughs]</b>

09:01.297 --> 09:03.297
<b>Prince Hulegu, Prince Kublai,</b>

09:04.097 --> 09:06.677
<b>the Great Khan will be
arriving here very soon.</b>

09:06.807 --> 09:07.887
<b>Please get ready.</b>

09:08.017 --> 09:10.017
<b>Fatima, see that? Look!</b>

09:10.137 --> 09:13.097
<b>My! That is truly
a splendid deer.</b>

09:13.187 --> 09:16.017
<b>And taking down a nimble hare
is quite impressive as well,</b>

09:16.147 --> 09:17.147
<b>Prince Kublai.</b>

09:17.267 --> 09:18.437
<b>[Kublai chuckles]</b>

09:18.647 --> 09:21.447
<b>Thanks. I guess
all my practicing has paid off.</b>

09:21.857 --> 09:23.447
<b>Who is that girl there?</b>

09:23.567 --> 09:25.777
<b>She's the tutor
who helps me read Elements,</b>

09:25.907 --> 09:27.487
<b>the one you went
and found for me.</b>

09:27.617 --> 09:29.907
<b>Oh, yes,
she's the scholar's daughter.</b>

09:30.707 --> 09:32.707
<b>Is she performing
her duties well?</b>

09:32.827 --> 09:34.747
<b>[SORGHAGHTANI]
I find her to be quite diligent,</b>

09:34.877 --> 09:36.627
<b>-clever, and thoughtful.
-[laughter]</b>

09:37.287 --> 09:39.627
<b>And when I see her smiling
so fetchingly,</b>

09:39.757 --> 09:41.717
<b>I am reminded how young she is.</b>

09:42.297 --> 09:44.047
<b>First,
you brought me Elements,</b>

09:44.177 --> 09:45.637
<b>then a remarkable tutor.</b>

09:45.757 --> 09:47.557
<b>Why yes, of course.</b>

09:47.677 --> 09:49.677
<b>-[HULEGU] Don't I look dashing?
-[laughs]</b>

09:49.807 --> 09:51.017
<b>-[Hulegu grunts]
-And powerful too.</b>

09:51.137 --> 09:54.227
<b>You do know, it is a tradition
after your first hunt</b>

09:54.347 --> 09:56.977
<b>to have the animal's fat rubbed
on your fingers,</b>

09:57.107 --> 09:59.397
<b>and the Great Khan
will do the honors.</b>

09:59.527 --> 10:01.607
<b>[LADY-IN-WAITING]
The Great Khan has arrived.</b>

10:01.737 --> 10:03.897
<b>-[HULEGU] Come on, let's go!
-[KUBLAI] Yeah.</b>

10:04.027 --> 10:06.367
<b>[boys laugh]</b>

10:09.787 --> 10:10.827
<b>[gasps]</b>

10:10.947 --> 10:12.827
<b>♪</b>

10:14.327 --> 10:17.787
<b>[SITARA (ADULT)] The emperor
of the Mongols, Genghis Khan.</b>

10:18.917 --> 10:22.127
<b>It was he who established
this mammoth empire.</b>

10:22.717 --> 10:24.547
<b>In only three years' time,</b>

10:24.677 --> 10:28.007
<b>the fates written in the stars
of those who were present here</b>

10:28.137 --> 10:31.677
<b>would be set into grand motion
and forever changed</b>

10:31.807 --> 10:34.307
<b>after his inevitable fall.</b>

10:39.187 --> 10:41.017
<b>[wind blowing]</b>

10:52.367 --> 10:56.417
<b>SUMMER, A.D. 1227</b>

11:00.667 --> 11:03.667
<b>[TOLUI]
Great Khan... rest assured...</b>

11:03.877 --> 11:08.347
<b>the future of the Mongols
shall be just as you willed it.</b>

11:10.347 --> 11:12.257
<b>Father... [grunts]</b>

11:12.387 --> 11:13.807
<b>♪</b>

11:34.997 --> 11:37.207
<b>[SITARA (ADULT)]
The fourth prince, Tolui,</b>

11:37.327 --> 11:39.497
<b>as the youngest brother,
and Otchigin,</b>

11:39.627 --> 11:41.917
<b>maintained their custom
of ultimogeniture</b>

11:42.037 --> 11:45.167
<b>and inherited the vast majority
of his father,</b>

11:45.297 --> 11:46.967
<b>Genghis Khan's legacy.</b>

11:47.087 --> 11:49.257
<b>In addition to land and fortune,</b>

11:49.387 --> 11:51.257
<b>Tolui's family came to control</b>

11:51.387 --> 11:54.137
<b>almost all
of the imperial Mongol military</b>

11:54.257 --> 11:55.927
<b>and its divisions.</b>

11:56.727 --> 11:59.057
<b>♪</b>

12:05.027 --> 12:07.187
<b>[excited chatter]</b>

12:10.987 --> 12:12.237
<b>[SITARA (ADULT)]
Following the death</b>

12:12.367 --> 12:15.077
<b>of Genghis Khan,
the empire needed to choose</b>

12:15.197 --> 12:16.907
<b>who would be its new ruler.</b>

12:18.287 --> 12:20.997
<b>But the tribal council known
as a Kurultai,</b>

12:21.127 --> 12:23.587
<b>where the imperial clan
and contending princes</b>

12:23.707 --> 12:25.627
<b>gather to elect a new emperor,</b>

12:25.757 --> 12:28.547
<b>wouldn't be convening
for another two years.</b>

12:29.007 --> 12:30.427
<b>During this time,</b>

12:30.547 --> 12:32.717
<b>Tolui didn't just
lead the military,</b>

12:32.847 --> 12:36.347
<b>but all state affairs
while acting as regent.</b>

12:37.057 --> 12:41.767
<b>AUTUMN, A.D. 1229</b>

12:41.897 --> 12:44.857
<b>Doesn't look to be
in the best of health, does it?</b>

12:44.977 --> 12:48.857
<b>That said, it should still be
safe to eat. Let's slaughter it.</b>

12:50.817 --> 12:52.237
<b>[sheep bleats]</b>

12:56.537 --> 12:59.367
<b>[sheep bleats]</b>

13:03.457 --> 13:05.287
<b>That should do it.</b>

13:05.997 --> 13:08.377
<b>Hey, keep on butchering away.</b>

13:08.467 --> 13:11.217
<b>A massive feast like this one
is once in a lifetime.</b>

13:12.717 --> 13:16.137
<b>Here you are. Clean up
all these entrails for me.</b>

13:18.057 --> 13:21.057
<b>[SITARA] In the name of Allah,
and Allah is the greatest.</b>

13:21.177 --> 13:23.557
<b>Uh... Hey, Fatima.</b>

13:23.977 --> 13:25.147
<b>Hmm?</b>

13:26.057 --> 13:29.187
<b>What is it? Does cutting
into the abdomen bother you?</b>

13:29.317 --> 13:31.527
<b>Oh, uh, I'm sorry,
it's just a habit.</b>

13:31.817 --> 13:33.907
<b>Muslims will only eat animals</b>

13:34.027 --> 13:36.367
<b>if their throats
have been cut open first, right?</b>

13:36.487 --> 13:38.657
<b>-Yes.
-But if you do it that way,</b>

13:38.787 --> 13:40.957
<b>you just spill blood
all over the ground.</b>

13:41.077 --> 13:43.957
<b>And draining the blood
makes the meat lose its flavor,</b>

13:44.077 --> 13:46.497
<b>so then you're stuck
eating a bland-tasting meal.</b>

13:47.037 --> 13:49.257
<b>Anyway, we do things
differently here,</b>

13:49.377 --> 13:50.717
<b>so try to put up with us.</b>

13:50.837 --> 13:53.927
<b>Oh, don't worry.
I've already gotten used to it.</b>

13:54.507 --> 13:57.047
<b>I've lived in Mongolia
for eight years now.</b>

13:57.177 --> 13:59.467
<b>I've even come to enjoy eating
unbled meat.</b>

13:59.597 --> 14:00.477
<b>Really?</b>

14:01.307 --> 14:02.887
<b>People who prefer
the taste of meat</b>

14:03.017 --> 14:04.387
<b>that's already been bled</b>

14:04.517 --> 14:05.647
<b>remind me of the sort of people</b>

14:05.767 --> 14:07.767
<b>who prefer sweets
that don't taste too sweet.</b>

14:07.897 --> 14:11.607
<b>I know. Well, you have
entrails to clean.</b>

14:11.737 --> 14:13.397
<b>Thank you, Fatima.</b>

14:13.527 --> 14:15.237
<b>Of course, my pleasure.</b>

14:15.357 --> 14:16.657
<b>♪</b>

14:19.407 --> 14:20.907
<b>[SITARA]
There's actually a good reason</b>

14:21.037 --> 14:24.037
<b>behind butchering an animal
by cutting its throat first.</b>

14:25.037 --> 14:28.587
<b>In the name of Allah,
and Allah is the greatest.</b>

14:29.167 --> 14:31.207
<b>-[slashes]
-[gasps, whimpers]</b>

14:31.337 --> 14:32.547
<b>[ZUMURRUD] It's all right.</b>

14:32.667 --> 14:34.757
<b>That's the most painless method
for the animal.</b>

14:35.177 --> 14:37.177
<b>If the meat
has been drained first,</b>

14:37.297 --> 14:41.057
<b>then it's a much nicer color,
and it doesn't spoil as fast.</b>

14:41.517 --> 14:43.267
<b>♪</b>

14:44.977 --> 14:46.017
<b>[SITARA] Still...</b>

14:46.137 --> 14:47.227
<b>it's no wonder</b>

14:47.517 --> 14:49.357
<b>I've gotten used to dark meat
that hasn't been bled.</b>

14:50.977 --> 14:52.397
<b>Eight years...</b>

14:52.527 --> 14:54.697
<b>That means I've been
living out here in Mongolia</b>

14:55.067 --> 14:57.737
<b>as many years
as I was in Tus.</b>

14:59.527 --> 15:04.117
<b>And yet, after all this time,
I haven't accomplished anything.</b>

15:04.247 --> 15:05.207
<b>That book...</b>

15:06.207 --> 15:09.127
<b>it's been within my grasp
for years now,</b>

15:09.247 --> 15:11.497
<b>but I still haven't
taken it back.</b>

15:12.087 --> 15:14.837
<b>One could hardly say
that I've reclaimed it.</b>

15:18.717 --> 15:19.757
<b>Oh...</b>

15:20.297 --> 15:21.927
<b>There's something hard in here.</b>

15:24.927 --> 15:26.557
<b>[gasps]</b>

15:27.767 --> 15:29.357
<b>Could this be...</b>

15:29.807 --> 15:32.607
<b>[MAN 1] Here. [grunts]
Take this one as well.</b>

15:32.727 --> 15:33.687
<b>[MAN 2] Hm.</b>

15:35.487 --> 15:38.617
<b>It's so strange.
I just can't believe it's him.</b>

15:38.737 --> 15:39.737
<b>Right?</b>

15:40.027 --> 15:42.617
<b>[MAN] That's enough.
Today's a day for celebration.</b>

15:42.737 --> 15:44.617
<b>♪</b>

15:44.747 --> 15:48.247
<b>This is the day our
new emperor's taking the throne.</b>

15:53.207 --> 15:54.507
<b>[exclaims]</b>

15:59.467 --> 16:00.717
<b>Ahh!</b>

16:08.517 --> 16:09.807
<b>[gasps]</b>

16:14.107 --> 16:15.487
<b>[exlaiming]</b>

16:18.697 --> 16:20.237
<b>Instead of using "Khan,"</b>

16:20.357 --> 16:22.327
<b>the new emperor's
calling himself the "Kha'an."</b>

16:22.447 --> 16:24.947
<b>So he's choosing
to bring back an ancient title</b>

16:25.077 --> 16:27.407
<b>that even Genghis Khan
didn't adopt.</b>

16:27.537 --> 16:29.867
<b>The Mongols have risen
to true greatness.</b>

16:29.997 --> 16:31.077
<b>It's a new world,</b>

16:31.327 --> 16:33.707
<b>and Mongolia will soon be
right at the center of it.</b>

16:33.837 --> 16:35.457
<b>[♪ festive music playing]</b>

16:44.257 --> 16:45.557
<b>[both grunt]</b>

16:47.477 --> 16:49.267
<b>-[all cheering]
-[grunts]</b>

16:52.517 --> 16:56.107
<b>As of right now, the Kurultai
has entered its forty-first day.</b>

16:56.227 --> 16:58.317
<b>I guess they must really be
at loggerheads then.</b>

16:58.437 --> 17:00.317
<b>The number forty-one
holds more meaning</b>

17:00.447 --> 17:01.607
<b>than you may be aware of.</b>

17:02.157 --> 17:04.407
<b>Khan's prophecy
said the forty-first day</b>

17:04.527 --> 17:05.947
<b>would be
quite an auspicious one.</b>

17:06.447 --> 17:10.207
<b>I think the prince is about
to be nominated by the clan.</b>

17:10.327 --> 17:11.877
<b>That means today...</b>

17:12.627 --> 17:14.337
<b>he'll take the throne.</b>

17:16.667 --> 17:18.507
<b>Onward, Great Kha'an.</b>

17:19.297 --> 17:21.547
<b>-This way.
-Now our hands will lead you.</b>

17:21.677 --> 17:22.677
<b>GENGHIS KHAN'S YOUNGER BROTHER
TEMÜGE</b>

17:22.797 --> 17:23.757
<b>SECOND PRINCE
CHAGATAI</b>

17:26.597 --> 17:28.057
<b>♪</b>

17:50.247 --> 17:52.827
<b>[BOTH]
Long live the new emperor!</b>

17:52.917 --> 17:55.457
<b>[ALL]
Long live the new emperor!</b>

17:55.577 --> 17:58.457
<b>Long live Ögedei Kha'an!</b>

17:58.917 --> 18:01.257
<b>Huzzah!</b>

18:01.377 --> 18:03.677
<b>[ALL] Huzzah!</b>

18:04.297 --> 18:06.757
<b>Huzzah!</b>

18:06.887 --> 18:09.137
<b>Huzzah!</b>

18:09.257 --> 18:10.467
<b>[Ögedei chuckles softly]</b>

18:11.017 --> 18:12.177
<b>[TOLUI] Great Kha'an!</b>

18:12.767 --> 18:15.857
<b>Today, I must heartily
congratulate you.</b>

18:16.477 --> 18:19.027
<b>Bravo, my brother Ögedei.</b>

18:19.437 --> 18:21.277
<b>Thank you, Tolui.</b>

18:21.567 --> 18:23.107
<b>♪</b>

18:43.167 --> 18:45.927
<b>Someday, from my bloodline,</b>

18:46.047 --> 18:48.257
<b>there may be those who,
if rolled in grass,</b>

18:48.387 --> 18:49.807
<b>wouldn't be eaten by a cow,</b>

18:49.927 --> 18:52.467
<b>nor eaten by a dog
if rolled in fat.</b>

18:56.767 --> 18:59.397
<b>Faced with an elk
emerging crosswise,</b>

18:59.517 --> 19:02.067
<b>and a mouse emerging lengthwise,</b>

19:02.187 --> 19:04.737
<b>they are sure to let both flee.</b>

19:07.527 --> 19:10.697
<b>Now, is it time for celebrating?</b>

19:10.827 --> 19:12.947
<b>My father's will
is to be carried out,</b>

19:13.077 --> 19:15.327
<b>and I'm free
of governing duties.</b>

19:16.577 --> 19:17.707
<b>Ahh!</b>

19:17.827 --> 19:20.207
<b>You did well filling in
all this time.</b>

19:20.537 --> 19:21.837
<b>Sorghaghtani...</b>

19:22.457 --> 19:24.207
<b>the only true regret I have</b>

19:24.337 --> 19:26.167
<b>is knowing
I couldn't make you empress.</b>

19:26.587 --> 19:27.797
<b>Oh, don't say that.</b>

19:27.927 --> 19:30.807
<b>I mean, when Father
shared his will with us,</b>

19:30.927 --> 19:32.097
<b>I couldn't help but think,</b>

19:32.637 --> 19:35.637
<b>"Why? Shouldn't it
have been me instead?"</b>

19:35.767 --> 19:37.557
<b>But this is how he explained it.</b>

19:37.977 --> 19:40.817
<b>"When a many-headed snake
tries to enter a burrow</b>

19:40.937 --> 19:43.977
<b>to outlast the cold,
the heads fight each other,</b>

19:44.107 --> 19:46.737
<b>and it soon dies
without making it inside.</b>

19:47.027 --> 19:49.237
<b>Conversely, a serpent
with one head</b>

19:49.357 --> 19:51.737
<b>will burrow inside
and easily survive."</b>

19:52.277 --> 19:56.327
<b>"Ögedei, use your brains
to become the head for us all."</b>

19:56.537 --> 19:57.867
<b>[exclaims]</b>

19:59.207 --> 20:00.917
<b>Being the Otchigin,</b>

20:01.037 --> 20:03.797
<b>I began to assume he favored me
over the others.</b>

20:04.337 --> 20:07.417
<b>But no, that isn't what
Father was thinking at all.</b>

20:07.917 --> 20:10.297
<b>The great power
he bestowed upon me</b>

20:10.427 --> 20:12.257
<b>wasn't simply for me alone.</b>

20:12.967 --> 20:15.427
<b>There's one thing that will make
the Mongols strong,</b>

20:15.557 --> 20:18.017
<b>and it's the bond we share
as brothers.</b>

20:18.137 --> 20:21.227
<b>That is what my father,
Genghis Khan,</b>

20:21.687 --> 20:23.017
<b>wished for.</b>

20:23.147 --> 20:25.187
<b>It is my greatest wish as well.</b>

20:28.777 --> 20:30.777
<b>[SORGHAGHTANI]
Your brotherly bond.</b>

20:38.997 --> 20:40.367
<b>[Sitara sighs]</b>

20:41.127 --> 20:43.287
<b>It doesn't matter to me
which one of the brothers</b>

20:43.417 --> 20:45.497
<b>sits on the throne
as the emperor.</b>

20:45.957 --> 20:49.377
<b>But breaking years of tradition
just to have him succeed you?</b>

20:49.507 --> 20:52.847
<b>Prince Ögedei couldn't possibly
be more qualified.</b>

20:54.927 --> 20:56.307
<b>[chuckles]</b>

20:56.427 --> 20:58.427
<b>Seems Shira
backed the wrong horse.</b>

21:01.267 --> 21:05.017
<b>In any case, the Kurultai can
finally come to an end now.</b>

21:06.107 --> 21:07.437
<b>[gasps]</b>

21:12.027 --> 21:15.277
<b>Is this stone
truly what I think it is?</b>

21:15.407 --> 21:17.657
<b>I read about it in
one of my mistress's books.</b>

21:17.787 --> 21:19.537
<b>It's extremely valuable.</b>

21:19.657 --> 21:20.957
<b>[SORGHAGHTANI] Fatima?</b>

21:21.077 --> 21:22.997
<b>[SITARA] Princess Sorghaghtani?</b>

21:27.957 --> 21:29.837
<b>[SITARA] Uh, what's the matter?</b>

21:31.047 --> 21:33.467
<b>I have something important
to discuss.</b>

21:33.587 --> 21:34.507
<b>With me?</b>

21:34.847 --> 21:36.177
<b>After tonight,</b>

21:36.307 --> 21:39.097
<b>I no longer want you
to be by my side anymore.</b>

21:39.887 --> 21:42.977
<b>Wait... What?
How could this be?</b>

21:43.097 --> 21:45.187
<b>You think I've done
something wrong, is that it?</b>

21:45.307 --> 21:46.727
<b>It is nothing like that at all.</b>

21:46.857 --> 21:48.567
<b>Then what could it be?</b>

21:50.737 --> 21:51.987
<b>[Sitara grunts]</b>

21:52.897 --> 21:54.027
<b>Hmm?</b>

21:54.947 --> 21:57.527
<b>Fatima, I want you...</b>

21:59.867 --> 22:02.617
<b>to act as a spy for me.</b>

22:03.117 --> 22:04.537
<b>[Sitara gasps]</b>

22:08.457 --> 22:11.167
<b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b>

23:37.927 --> 23:40.797
<b>[SITARA (ADULT)] Next time,
"A Snake Shows Its Colors.</b>

23:40.927 --> 23:42.887
<b>Man Hides His Colors."</b>
